OL,3,GNEWSARevamp for city's oldest building
OL,4,Aback on track
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to revamp an 11th Century church
OL,7,Fare back on track after the project was
OL,8,Fawarded #2.65m, a council has said.
OL,10,FThe Holy Trinity Church is believed to
OL,11,Fbe the oldest building still standing
OL,12,Fin Colchester, but it ceased being used
OL,13,Ffor religious services in 1954 and has
OL,14,Fbeen empty since 2017.
OL,16,FColchester City Council said it hoped
OL,17,Fthe money awarded by The National
OL,18,FLottery Heritage Fund would help the
OL,19,Fauthority reopen it as a community
OL,20,Fspace for the public.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
